This PR fixes #1532.

The `parseHeaders` method doesn't handle the possibility of the array as the value in the headers. So I've added 1 check to prevent array serialization. I've added 2 tests for that.

The response now is:

```js
{
  statusCode: 200,
  headers: {
    'set-cookie': ['a=b', 'c=d', 'd=e'];
  }
}
```

